.Dd 2025-09-30
.Dt EVP_IDEA_CBC 3ossl
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm EVP_idea_cbc ,
.Nm EVP_idea_cfb ,
.Nm EVP_idea_cfb64 ,
.Nm EVP_idea_ecb ,
.Nm EVP_idea_ofb
.Nd EVP IDEA cipher
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.In openssl/evp.h
.Ft const EVP_CIPHER *
.Fo EVP_idea_cbc
.Fa void
.Fc
.Ft const EVP_CIPHER *
.Fo EVP_idea_cfb
.Fa void
.Fc
.Ft const EVP_CIPHER *
.Fo EVP_idea_cfb64
.Fa void
.Fc
.Ft const EVP_CIPHER *
.Fo EVP_idea_ecb
.Fa void
.Fc
.Ft const EVP_CIPHER *
.Fo EVP_idea_ofb
.Fa void
.Fc
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The IDEA encryption algorithm for EVP.
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It EVP_idea_cbc(), EVP_idea_cfb(), EVP_idea_cfb64(), EVP_idea_ecb(), EVP_idea_ofb()
The IDEA encryption algorithm in CBC, CFB, ECB and OFB modes
respectively.
.El
.Sh NOTES
Developers should be aware of the negative performance implications of
calling these functions multiple times and should consider using
.Xr EVP_CIPHER_fetch 3
with
.Xr EVP_CIPHER-IDEA 7
instead.
See
.Xr crypto 7
for further information.
.Sh RETURN VALUES
These functions return an
.Sy EVP_CIPHER
structure that contains the implementation of the symmetric cipher.
See
.Xr EVP_CIPHER_meth_new 3
for details of the
.Sy EVP_CIPHER
structure.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr evp 7 ,
.Xr EVP_EncryptInit 3 ,
.Xr EVP_CIPHER_meth_new 3
